{"model":"qwen2.5-coder:7b","created_at":"2026-10-08T09:40:23.7029773Z","response":"```python\ndef solve(payload):\n    text = payload.get(\"text\", \"\")\n    result = []\n    i = 0\n    while i \u003c len(text):\n        if text[i] == '\\x1b':  # ESC character\n            if i + 1 \u003c len(text) and text[i + 1] == '[':\n                # Handle ANSI escape sequence starting with ESC[\n                j = i + 2\n                while j \u003c len(text) and text[j].isalnum() or text[j] in ' ;':\n                    j += 1\n                if j \u003c len(text) and (text[j] \u003e= '@' and text[j] \u003c= '~'):\n                    i = j\n                else:\n                    result.append(text[i])\n            else:\n                # Handle other ANSI escape sequences\n                j = i + 1\n                while j \u003c len(text) and text[j].isalnum():\n                    j += 1\n                if j \u003c len(text) and (text[j] \u003e= '@' and text[j] \u003c= '~'):\n                    i = j\n                else:\n                    result.append(text[i])\n        else:\n            result.append(text[i])\n        i += 1\n    return ''.join(result)\n```","done":true,"done_reason":"stop","total_duration":5307417500,"load_duration":4221100,"prompt_eval_count":391,"prompt_eval_cached_count":390,"prompt_eval_duration":284810000,"eval_count":249,"eval_duration":5015595000}